# Class-table features are rules text unless an explicit PCGen numeric grant is present.
Shifter Class Features 1	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpheresClassFeature	DESC:Level 1: Casting, quick transformation, shapeshifter, spell points, wild empathy. See https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/shifter for effects, timing and prerequisites.
Shifter Class Features 2	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpheresClassFeature	DESC:Level 2: Bestial trait. See https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/shifter for effects, timing and prerequisites.
Shifter Class Features 3	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpheresClassFeature	DESC:Level 3: Endurance. See https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/shifter for effects, timing and prerequisites.
Shifter Class Features 4	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpheresClassFeature	DESC:Level 4: Bestial trait, enhanced attacks (magic), lingering transformation. See https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/shifter for effects, timing and prerequisites.
Shifter Class Features 5	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpheresClassFeature	DESC:Level 5: Steal language. See https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/shifter for effects, timing and prerequisites.
Shifter Class Features 6	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpheresClassFeature	DESC:Level 6: Bestial trait. See https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/shifter for effects, timing and prerequisites.
Shifter Class Features 7	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpheresClassFeature	DESC:Level 7: Enhanced attacks (cold iron, silver), enhanced physicality. See https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/shifter for effects, timing and prerequisites.
Shifter Class Features 8	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpheresClassFeature	DESC:Level 8: Bestial trait, immunity to poison. See https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/shifter for effects, timing and prerequisites.
Shifter Class Features 9	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpheresClassFeature	DESC:Level 9: Extended transformation. See https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/shifter for effects, timing and prerequisites.
Shifter Class Features 10	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpheresClassFeature	DESC:Level 10: Bestial trait, enhanced attacks (chaotic). See https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/shifter for effects, timing and prerequisites.
Shifter Class Features 11	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpheresClassFeature	DESC:Level 11: Boundless communication. See https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/shifter for effects, timing and prerequisites.
Shifter Class Features 12	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpheresClassFeature	DESC:Level 12: Bestial trait, immunity to disease. See https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/shifter for effects, timing and prerequisites.
Shifter Class Features 13	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpheresClassFeature	DESC:Level 13: Enhanced physicality. See https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/shifter for effects, timing and prerequisites.
Shifter Class Features 14	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpheresClassFeature	DESC:Level 14: Bestial trait. See https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/shifter for effects, timing and prerequisites.
Shifter Class Features 15	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpheresClassFeature	DESC:Level 15: Endless communication. See https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/shifter for effects, timing and prerequisites.
Shifter Class Features 16	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpheresClassFeature	DESC:Level 16: Bestial trait, enhanced attacks (adamantine). See https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/shifter for effects, timing and prerequisites.
Shifter Class Features 17	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpheresClassFeature	DESC:Level 17: Greater transformation. See https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/shifter for effects, timing and prerequisites.
Shifter Class Features 18	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpheresClassFeature	DESC:Level 18: Bestial trait. See https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/shifter for effects, timing and prerequisites.
Shifter Class Features 19	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpheresClassFeature	DESC:Level 19: Enhanced physicality. See https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/shifter for effects, timing and prerequisites.
Shifter Class Features 20	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpheresClassFeature	DESC:Level 20: Bestial trait, second skin. See https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/shifter for effects, timing and prerequisites.
Shifter Sphere Mastery	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpheresClassFeature	ABILITY:Spheres Magic Talent|AUTOMATIC|Alteration Sphere	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_CL_ALTERATION|SPHERES_SHIFTER_LEVEL-SPHERES_CASTER_LEVEL	DESC:Free Alteration sphere; class-level caster level for this sphere where specified by the source.
Shifter Accommodating Form	CATEGORY:Shifter Bestial Trait	PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_SHIFTER_LEVEL,1	DESC:Source: The Apex Shifter The shifter chooses one Alteration sphere talent [including the base talent that grants Blank Form] that she possesses that grants traits. When she applies a shapeshift to herself, she can choose one of the traits from that talent that does not cost an additional spell point to apply. That trait does not count towards her maximum amount of traits she may possess on a form. She may select this bestial trait once per every 4 shifter levels she possesses [minimum 1]. Each time she does so she selects another talent.
Shifter Adaptation (Ex)	CATEGORY:Shifter Bestial Trait	PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_SHIFTER_LEVEL,1	DESC:The shifter suffers no harm from being in a hot or cold environment and can exist comfortably in conditions between -50 and 140 degrees Fahrenheit [-45 and 60 degrees Celsius] without having to attempt Fortitude saves. Her equipment is likewise protected. This trait does not provide any protection from fire or cold damage, nor does it protect against other environmental hazards such as smoke, lack of air, and so forth. If she possesses the flight bestial trait, she also is acclimated to living at high altitudes and treats her altitude zone as if it were one lower. At shifter level 10, she may treat it as two levels lower. If she possesses the home in water bestial trait, she also is immune to the pressures of the ocean and takes no damage from water pressure.
Shifter Adaptation - Improved (requires adaptation)	CATEGORY:Shifter Bestial Trait	PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_SHIFTER_LEVEL,1	DESC:The shifter gains resistance to acid, cold, electricity, fire, and sonic equal to her shifter level.
Shifter Adaptation - Greater (requires adaptation - improved adaptation - shifter 10)	CATEGORY:Shifter Bestial Trait	PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_SHIFTER_LEVEL,1	DESC:Choose a damage type the shifter has resistance to through improved adaptation. She gains immunity to that damage type. She may select this trait multiple times. The effects do not stack. Each time it is gained, choose another damage type.
Shifter Animal Advisor (Su)	CATEGORY:Shifter Bestial Trait	PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_SHIFTER_LEVEL,1	DESC:The shifter gains a familiar, treating her shifter levels as wizard levels. This stacks with levels gained from other sources.
Shifter Animal Hide (Ex)	CATEGORY:Shifter Bestial Trait	PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_SHIFTER_LEVEL,1	DESC:The shifter gains a +1 natural armor bonus. This stacks with all other sources of natural armor. This bestial trait can be taken multiple times. The effects stack.
Shifter Animal Trainer (Ex)	CATEGORY:Shifter Bestial Trait	PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_SHIFTER_LEVEL,1	DESC:The shifter gains a bonus equal to 1/2 her shifter level to all Handle Animal checks. The shifter may reduce the time needed to teach an animal a new trick or train an animal for a general purpose to 1 day per 1 week required by increasing the DC by +5. She can also train more than one animal at once, although each animal after the first adds +2 to the DC.
Shifter Barding (Su) (requires shifter 6)	CATEGORY:Shifter Bestial Trait	PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_SHIFTER_LEVEL,1	DESC:When assuming a form with the Alteration sphere that would normally cause the shifter’s worn armor to meld into her form, she may instead mold her armor around her new form, allowing her to keep her armor’s bonuses and benefits.
Shifter Bestial Rage (Ex)	CATEGORY:Shifter Bestial Trait	PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_SHIFTER_LEVEL,1	DESC:As a standard action, the shifter may let out a ferocious howl. This allows her to attempt an Intimidate check to demoralize all enemies within 30 feet of her.
Shifter Bestial Speed (Ex)	CATEGORY:Shifter Bestial Trait	PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_SHIFTER_LEVEL,1	DESC:The shifter increases all of her movement speeds by 10 feet. This bestial trait can be taken multiple times. The effects stack.
Shifter Bite (Ex)	CATEGORY:Shifter Bestial Trait	PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_SHIFTER_LEVEL,1	DESC:The shifter gains a bite attack. This is a primary attack dealing 1d6 damage [1d4 Small]. If this is the only attack made during the shifter’s turn, she adds 1-1/2 her Strength bonus to the damage dealt.
Shifter Braineater	CATEGORY:Shifter Bestial Trait	PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_SHIFTER_LEVEL,1	DESC:You gain Brain Consumption as a bonus feat. If you already possess Brain Consumption, you may immediately retrain Brain Consumption at no additional cost in money or time, selecting a new, valid feat [such as retraining a feat gained with level advancement to another valid feat]. You may benefit from having two brains consumed at once, in which case you gain a bonus to one skill that one creature had ranks in and another skill that the other had ranks in.
Shifter Braineater Savant (requires braineater)	CATEGORY:Shifter Bestial Trait	PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_SHIFTER_LEVEL,1	DESC:You gain Consumptive Intuition as a bonus feat. When you consume a creature’s brain, you may add that brain to a repository of knowledge known as your brain pool. The talents gained from Consumptive Intuition may be gained from any creature whose brain you have in your brain pool rather than the last creature whose brain you have consumed [for example, if you possess four instances of the Consumptive Intuition feat, you may use these feats to gain 2 talents from one brain, 1 talent from a second brain, and 1 talent from a third brain]. The number of brains you may have in your brain pool is equal to your casting ability modifier + the number of times you have taken the Consumptive Intuition feat. You may select this bestial trait multiple times, each time gaining Consumptive Intuition as a bonus feat an additional time.
Shifter Braineating Connoisseur (requires braineater savant - shifter level 12th)	CATEGORY:Shifter Bestial Trait	PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_SHIFTER_LEVEL,1	DESC:You constantly benefit from any talents you gain from the Consumptive Intuition feat rather than only having them active for a limited duration per day. You may exchange which talents you have active whenever you rest to regain spell points or consume another brain. This does not allow you to benefit from more of these talents than you have instances of the Consumptive Intuition feat.
Shifter Breath Weapon (Su)	CATEGORY:Shifter Bestial Trait	PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_SHIFTER_LEVEL,1	DESC:The shifter gains a breath weapon which deals acid, cold, electricity, or fire damage in a 30-foot cone or a 60-foot line. These decisions are made when she selects this bestial trait. This breath weapon deals 1d8 damage plus an additional 1d8 damage for every 2 shifter levels she possesses beyond 1st. Creatures in the area of effect are allowed a Reflex save for half damage [DC 10 + 1/2 the shifter’s level + the shifter’s casting ability modifier]. Once the shifter has used her breath weapon, she cannot use it again for another 1d4 rounds.
Shifter Breath Weapon - Improved (requires breath weapon bestial trait - shifter level 4)	CATEGORY:Shifter Bestial Trait	PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_SHIFTER_LEVEL,1	DESC:The shifter’s breath weapon’s range improves to a 60-foot cone or a 120-foot line. In addition, she uses d10s rather than d8s to determine the damage of her breath weapon and may use her breath weapon once per round rather than once every 1d4 rounds.
Shifter Chameleon (Ex) (requires shifter 10)	CATEGORY:Shifter Bestial Trait	PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_SHIFTER_LEVEL,1	DESC:The shifter gains the ability to hide in plain sight, using Stealth without cover or concealment, even while being directly observed.
Shifter Champion	CATEGORY:Shifter Bestial Trait	PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_SHIFTER_LEVEL,1	DESC:The shifter gains a Champion feat of her choice as a bonus feat [see Champion Feats]. She must meet the prerequisites of the feat. This trait can be gained multiple times.
Shifter Claws (Ex)	CATEGORY:Shifter Bestial Trait	PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_SHIFTER_LEVEL,1	DESC:The shifter gains a pair of retractable claws, which may be retracted or expanded as a free action. These are primary attacks that deal 1d4 damage [1d3 Small].
Shifter Combat Talent	CATEGORY:Shifter Bestial Trait	PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_SHIFTER_LEVEL,1	DESC:You gain a bonus combat talent. This bestial trait may be taken more than once, granting an additional talent each time.
Shifter Defensive Shift	CATEGORY:Shifter Bestial Trait	PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_SHIFTER_LEVEL,1	DESC:Source: The Apex Shifter When the shifter applies a shapeshift to herself, she can enter total defense as part of that same action. At the beginning of her next turn, she is staggered for 1 round.
Shifter Detachable Claws (Ex) (requires claws)	CATEGORY:Shifter Bestial Trait	PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_SHIFTER_LEVEL,1	DESC:The shifter may hurl her claws as a ranged natural attack. This is treated as a thrown weapon with a 10-foot range increment. Each hand is treated as a different weapon [allowing her to throw each as a separate attack]. Thrown claws may be regrown as a swift action.
Shifter Earth Glide (Su) (requires home in the underground - shifter 10)	CATEGORY:Shifter Bestial Trait	PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_SHIFTER_LEVEL,1	DESC:The shifter gains earth glide. She can pass through stone, dirt, or almost any other sort of earth except metal as easily as a fish swims through water. If protected against fire damage, she may glide through lava. She leaves behind no tunnel, hole, ripple, or any other sign of her presence.
Shifter Evasion (Ex)	CATEGORY:Shifter Bestial Trait	PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_SHIFTER_LEVEL,1	DESC:The shifter can avoid even magical and unusual attacks with great agility. If she succeeds at a Reflex saving throw against an attack that normally deals half damage on a successful save, she instead takes no damage. Evasion can be used only if she is wearing light armor, or no armor, and carrying no more than a light load. If she is helpless, she loses the benefit of evasion.
Shifter Fast Healing (Ex) (requires quick healing bestial trait - shifter level 10)	CATEGORY:Shifter Bestial Trait	PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_SHIFTER_LEVEL,1	DESC:The shifter gains fast healing 1. The shifter may take this talent a second time to improve this fast healing to be equal to half their shifter level.
Shifter Feinting Shift	CATEGORY:Shifter Bestial Trait	PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_SHIFTER_LEVEL,1	DESC:Source: The Apex Shifter When the shifter applies a shapeshift to herself, she may make a feint check as part of that same action.
Shifter Ferocious (Ex) (requires endurance - shifter 6)	CATEGORY:Shifter Bestial Trait	PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_SHIFTER_LEVEL,1	DESC:The shifter gains the Diehard feat.
Shifter Fey Kin (Su)	CATEGORY:Shifter Bestial Trait	PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_SHIFTER_LEVEL,1	DESC:The shifter gains low-light vision if she does not already possess it. The shifter may move through any sort of undergrowth [such as natural thorns, briars, overgrown areas, and similar terrain] at her normal speed and without taking damage or suffering any other impairment. Thorns, briars, and overgrown areas that have been magically manipulated to impede motion, however, still affect her.
Shifter Flight (Ex) (requires shifter 6)	CATEGORY:Shifter Bestial Trait	PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_SHIFTER_LEVEL,1	DESC:The shifter gains a 30 feet fly speed with maneuverability [clumsy].
Shifter Flight - Perfect (requires shifter 6)	CATEGORY:Shifter Bestial Trait	PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_SHIFTER_LEVEL,1	DESC:If the shifter possesses a flight speed, her maneuverability increases by one step +1 step per 6 shifter levels beyond 6th, to a maximum of [perfect].
Shifter Flight - Skillful (Ex)	CATEGORY:Shifter Bestial Trait	PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_SHIFTER_LEVEL,1	DESC:The shifter gains either the Flyby Attack, Hover, or Wingover feats. She may select this trait up to 3 times, gaining another feat each time.
Shifter Fortification (Ex) (requires shifter level 6)	CATEGORY:Shifter Bestial Trait	PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_SHIFTER_LEVEL,1	DESC:The shifter gains a 25percent chance to negate critical hits or sneak attacks and other precision damage [so damage is rolled normally instead]. This does not stack with armor with the fortification special ability or any other similar effects. This bestial trait can be selected again starting at 12th level and 18th level, increasing the chance to negate critical hits or sneak attacks by an additional 25percent for every additional time it is taken [to a maximum of 75percent at 18th level].
Shifter Gore (Ex)	CATEGORY:Shifter Bestial Trait	PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_SHIFTER_LEVEL,1	DESC:The shifter gains the ability to sprout a horn from her head as a free action. This grants her a gore attack dealing 1d6 damage [1d4 Small]. If this is the only attack made during her turn, add 1-1/2 her Strength bonus to the damage dealt.
Shifter Grab (Ex)	CATEGORY:Shifter Bestial Trait	PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_SHIFTER_LEVEL,1	DESC:The shifter gains the grab universal monster ability with a natural attack of her choice. If the shifter loses that natural attack due to a shapeshift, she may designate a different natural attack for this to augment for the duration.
Shifter Graft Weapon (Su)	CATEGORY:Shifter Bestial Trait	PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_SHIFTER_LEVEL,1	DESC:The shifter may spend 1 minute to graft a weapon to a limb capable of wielding a weapon as per the Graft Weapon trait of the Morphic Weapon Alteration talent. This graft persists until the weapon is removed as a standard action.
Shifter Home in Nature (Ex)	CATEGORY:Shifter Bestial Trait	PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_SHIFTER_LEVEL,1	DESC:The shifter gains a favored terrain, as the ranger class feature. She may select this trait once at 2nd level, plus an additional time for every 4 shifter levels she possesses beyond 2nd. Each time this trait is gained beyond the first, she gains an additional favored terrain, and the bonuses granted in one of her favored terrains [even the one just selected if she desires] increases by 2.
Shifter Home in the Underground (Ex) (requires shifter 4)	CATEGORY:Shifter Bestial Trait	PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_SHIFTER_LEVEL,1	DESC:The shifter gains a burrow speed of 20 feet.
Shifter Home in Water (Ex)	CATEGORY:Shifter Bestial Trait	PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_SHIFTER_LEVEL,1	DESC:The shifter gains the amphibious subtype [including the ability to breathe underwater] and a 30 feet swim speed.
Shifter Impaling Charge (Ex) (requires powerful charge)	CATEGORY:Shifter Bestial Trait	PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_SHIFTER_LEVEL,1	DESC:The shifter gains the Impaling Charge feat.
Shifter Improved Damage Reduction (requires shifter level 4)	CATEGORY:Shifter Bestial Trait	PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_SHIFTER_LEVEL,1	DESC:Any damage reduction the shifter possesses from an Alteration sphere trait or shifter class features improves by 1, plus an additional 1 for every 4 shifter levels she possess beyond 4th. This does not grant the shifter any damage reduction if they do not have any form of damage reduction already.
Shifter Improved Evasion (Ex) (requires evasion - shifter 10)	CATEGORY:Shifter Bestial Trait	PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_SHIFTER_LEVEL,1	DESC:The shifter’s evasion ability improves, so that while she still takes no damage on a successful Reflex saving throw, she henceforth takes only half damage on a failed save.
Shifter Improved Natural Attack (Ex) (requires shifter 6)	CATEGORY:Shifter Bestial Trait	PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_SHIFTER_LEVEL,1	DESC:One of the shifter’s natural attacks increases its damage by one die size. If the shifter loses that natural attack due to a shapeshift, she may designate a different natural attack for this to augment for the duration. The shifter may select this trait multiple times. A single natural attack cannot be improved more than once. Each time this trait is gained, increase the number of natural attacks that may be augmented at one time by 1.
Shifter Jumper (Ex)	CATEGORY:Shifter Bestial Trait	PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_SHIFTER_LEVEL,1	DESC:The shifter adds her shifter level as a bonus on all Acrobatics checks made to jump. When attempting a jump, she is always considered to have a running start. The shifter may attempt an Acrobatics check to jump as part of her charge. If her vertical height exceeds the height of her target, the target is flat-footed against the attacks granted by that charge and the critical threat range of her natural attacks is increased by 1. This increase stacks with and is applied after effects such as keen and Improved Critical.
Shifter Learned Behavior	CATEGORY:Shifter Bestial Trait	PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_SHIFTER_LEVEL,1	DESC:The shifter gains the Alteration sphere Mimicry talent as a bonus talent. The shifter may use the Mimicry talent to study one of her subordinates as a swift action without spending a spell point. A talent the shifter gains using the Mimicry talent this way lasts for an hour per shifter level instead of just one hour.
Shifter Living Death (Su) (requires adaptation or undead kin)	CATEGORY:Shifter Bestial Trait	PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_SHIFTER_LEVEL,1	DESC:The shifter no longer needs to breathe. This grants immunity to inhaled poison as well as suffocation [such as from being underground, underwater, or in a vacuum] but does not grant immunity to cloud or gas attacks that do not require breathing.
Shifter Magical Attacks (Su)	CATEGORY:Shifter Bestial Trait	PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_SHIFTER_LEVEL,1	DESC:The shifter’s natural attacks all gain a +1 enhancement bonus, as if they were magical weapons. This bonus increases by +1 for every 5 shifter levels possessed.
Shifter Melded Equipment (Su) (requires shifter 10)	CATEGORY:Shifter Bestial Trait	PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_SHIFTER_LEVEL,1	DESC:The shifter may activate magic items that have melded into her shapeshifted form.
Shifter Multiattack	CATEGORY:Shifter Bestial Trait	PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_SHIFTER_LEVEL,1	DESC:The shifter gains the Multiattack feat.
Shifter Nightvision	CATEGORY:Shifter Bestial Trait	PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_SHIFTER_LEVEL,1	DESC:The shifter gains darkvision 60 feet. If she already possesses darkvision, increase the range of her darkvision by 30 feet.
Shifter Permanent Size Change (Ex) (requires shifter 6)	CATEGORY:Shifter Bestial Trait	PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_SHIFTER_LEVEL,1	DESC:The shifter’s size permanently changes to either Small, Medium, Tiny, or Large, as if using the Size Change Alteration talent.
Shifter Permanent Size Change - Greater (Ex) (requires permanent size change - shifter 10)	CATEGORY:Shifter Bestial Trait	PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_SHIFTER_LEVEL,1	DESC:The shifter may permanently change her size to either Huge or Diminutive, as if using the Size Change Alteration talent sphere.
Shifter Permanent Size Change - Incredible (Ex) (requires permanent greater size change - shifter 16)	CATEGORY:Shifter Bestial Trait	PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_SHIFTER_LEVEL,1	DESC:The shifter may permanently change their size to either Gargantuan or Fine as if using the Size Mastery Alteration talent.
Shifter Permanent Size Change - Supreme (Ex) (requires incredible permanent size change - shifter 20)	CATEGORY:Shifter Bestial Trait	PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_SHIFTER_LEVEL,1	DESC:The shifter may permanently change their size to Colossal as if using the Size Mastery Alteration talent.
Shifter Poison (Ex) (requires shifter 6)	CATEGORY:Shifter Bestial Trait	PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_SHIFTER_LEVEL,1	DESC:The shifter selects a single natural attack [one claw, bite, etc.] she possesses. This natural attack inflicts poison on a successful attack [injury; save Fortitude DC 10 + 1/2 her shifter level + her casting ability modifier; frequency 1/round for 6 rounds; effect 1d2 ability damage; cure 1 save]. The type of ability damage dealt by this poison is chosen when the shifter first selects this trait. If the shifter loses that natural attack due to a shapeshift, she may designate a different natural attack for this to augment for the duration. She may select this trait multiple times. The effects do not stack. Each time it is gained, select another natural attack to inflict the same poison.
Shifter Poison - Improved (Ex) (requires poison - shifter 10)	CATEGORY:Shifter Bestial Trait	PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_SHIFTER_LEVEL,1	DESC:The shifter selects one natural attack augmented by the poison bestial trait. The effect of this poison improves to 1d2 ability damage to 2 ability scores, 2 saves. The second ability score damaged by this poison are selected when this trait is first taken, with the first ability score being the one the shifter selected with the poison bestial trait. She may select this trait multiple times. The effects do not stack. Each time it is gained, select another natural attack augmented by the poison trait to inflict the same poison.
Shifter Pounce (Ex) (requires shifter 6)	CATEGORY:Shifter Bestial Trait	PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_SHIFTER_LEVEL,1	DESC:The shifter gains the pounce special ability, allowing her to make a full-attack at the end of a charge.
Shifter Powerful Charge (Ex)	CATEGORY:Shifter Bestial Trait	PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_SHIFTER_LEVEL,1	DESC:If the shifter possess a gore attack, she may use it to make a powerful charge. When charging, her gore attack doubles its damage dice plus 1-1/2 times her Strength bonus.
Shifter Prey (Ex)	CATEGORY:Shifter Bestial Trait	PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_SHIFTER_LEVEL,1	DESC:The shifter gains a favored enemy, as the ranger class feature. She may select this trait once at 2nd level, plus an additional time for every 4 shifter levels she possesses beyond 2nd. Each time this is gained after the first, she gains an additional favored enemy, and the bonuses granted against one of her favored enemies [even the one just selected if she desires] increase by 2.
Shifter Quick Healing (Su)	CATEGORY:Shifter Bestial Trait	PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_SHIFTER_LEVEL,1	DESC:As a free action once per round, the shifter may heal 5 hit points as if she had the fast healing ability. She may heal 5 hit points per day in this manner for every 2 shifter levels possessed. If she falls unconscious because of hit point damage and she still has healing from this ability, the ability activates automatically each round until she is conscious again or the ability is depleted for the day. This bestial trait can be gained multiple times. Each time it is gained, increased the maximum hit points that can be healed with this ability by an additional 5 per 2 shifter levels.
Shifter Reach (Ex) (requires shifter 6)	CATEGORY:Shifter Bestial Trait	PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_SHIFTER_LEVEL,1	DESC:The shifter’s reach increases by 5 feet. The shifter does not threaten this enlarged area unless she takes this talent a second time.
Shifter Resistant Shift	CATEGORY:Shifter Bestial Trait	PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_SHIFTER_LEVEL,1	DESC:Source: The Apex Shifter When the shifter applies a shapeshift to herself and becomes a size category larger then she was before, she gains stalwart [if she makes a Fortitude or Will saving throw against an attack that has a reduced effect on a successful save, she instead avoids the effect entirely] for 1 round per 5 levels of shifter she possesses [minimum 1], or until she applies a new shapeshift to herself [whichever is shorter]. When she applies a shapeshift to herself and becomes a size category smaller than she was before, she gains evasion [As the shifter bestial trait] for 1 round per 5 levels of shifter she possesses [minimum 1], or until she applies a new shapeshift to herself [whichever is shorter].
Shifter Scent (Ex)	CATEGORY:Shifter Bestial Trait	PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_SHIFTER_LEVEL,1	DESC:The shifter gains the scent ability. If she possesses home in water, she also gains the ability to detect creatures by scent up to a 180-foot radius underwater and can detect blood in the water at ranges of up to a mile.
Shifter See in Darkness (Su) (requires darkvision - shifter 10)	CATEGORY:Shifter Bestial Trait	PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_SHIFTER_LEVEL,1	DESC:The shifter may see perfectly in darkness of any kind, even magical darkness that normally impedes darkvision.
Shifter Shape Weapon (Su)	CATEGORY:Shifter Bestial Trait	PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_SHIFTER_LEVEL,1	DESC:As a standard action the shifter may reshape one of her limbs capable of wielding a weapon into a weapon she is proficient in as per the Shape Weapon trait of the Morphic Weapon Alteration talent. Use her shifter level to determine the effective caster level of this ability. This stacks normally with caster levels gained from other sources. This change persists until dismissed as a free action.
Shifter Shifting Style	CATEGORY:Shifter Bestial Trait	PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_SHIFTER_LEVEL,1	DESC:Source: The Apex Shifter Requires: At least 1 combat talent not from the Alchemy, Equipment, Tech, or Trap sphere; Knowledge of Many Shapes class feature When the shifter applies a shapeshift to herself, she may spend an additional spell point to gain a combat talent she doesn’t currently possess [excluding the Alchemy, Equipment, Tech, or Trap sphere]. She must possess the base sphere associated with the talent in order to gain it. This talent lasts for 1 minute or until she applies a new shapeshift to yourself.
Shifter Shredding Blows (Ex)	CATEGORY:Shifter Bestial Trait	PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_SHIFTER_LEVEL,1	DESC:The shifter’s weapon attacks ignore an amount of hardness equal to 1/2 the shifter’s level [minimum 1]. When attacking a target with damage reduction the shifter’s attacks do not bypass [such as DR 3/–], the shifter ignores an amount of damage reduction equal to 1/2 the shifter’s level [minimum 1].
Shifter Snatch (requires Huge size)	CATEGORY:Shifter Bestial Trait	PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_SHIFTER_LEVEL,1	DESC:The shifter gains the Snatch feat.
Shifter Spider Climb (Ex)	CATEGORY:Shifter Bestial Trait	PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_SHIFTER_LEVEL,1	DESC:The shifter gains a 30 feet climb speed.
Shifter Spider Climb - Improved (Ex) (requires spider climb)	CATEGORY:Shifter Bestial Trait	PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_SHIFTER_LEVEL,1	DESC:If the shifter possess a climb speed, that climb speed increases by 10 feet. She may climb virtually on any surface, no matter how slick or sheer. She can climb and travel on vertical surfaces or even traverse ceilings as well as a spider does. She needs not attempt Climb checks to traverse a vertical or horizontal surface [even upside down].
Shifter Spines (Ex)	CATEGORY:Shifter Bestial Trait	PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_SHIFTER_LEVEL,1	DESC:The shifter grows spines, thorns, or spikes. These may be treated as armor spikes of their size [1d6 Medium, 1d4 Small, 20x2, piercing] but may be enhanced as natural weapons and may be wielded as a secondary natural weapon if beneficial.
Shifter Sprint (Ex)	CATEGORY:Shifter Bestial Trait	PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_SHIFTER_LEVEL,1	DESC:The shifter gains the Run feat. Once per hour, the shifter may move up to 10 times her speed when running or charging.
Shifter Superior Senses (Ex) (requires shifter 10)	CATEGORY:Shifter Bestial Trait	PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_SHIFTER_LEVEL,1	DESC:The shifter gains blindsense out to 15 feet.
Shifter Taste for Blood (Ex) (requires shifter 6)	CATEGORY:Shifter Bestial Trait	PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_SHIFTER_LEVEL,1	DESC:If the shifter spends a standard action to feast on a corpse killed within the last minute, she gains a +4 morale bonus to her Strength and Constitution for 1 round per shifter level.
Shifter Track Master (Ex)	CATEGORY:Shifter Bestial Trait	PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_SHIFTER_LEVEL,1	DESC:The shifter adds half her shifter level [minimum 1] to Survival checks. The shifter no longer leaves a trail if she does not wish to.
Shifter Trip (Ex) (requires shifter 6)	CATEGORY:Shifter Bestial Trait	PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_SHIFTER_LEVEL,1	DESC:If the shifter possesses a bite attack, she may attempt to trip the target of a successful bite attack as a free action. This does not provoke an attack of opportunity, and she cannot be tripped in return.
Shifter Undead Kin (Su)	CATEGORY:Shifter Bestial Trait	PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_SHIFTER_LEVEL,1	DESC:The shifter is healed by both positive and negative energy.
Shifter Web (Ex)	CATEGORY:Shifter Bestial Trait	PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_SHIFTER_LEVEL,1	DESC:The shifter may create webs as the Web trait from the Vermin Transformation Alteration talent. This ability is usable 8 times per day, rather than once per minute.
